\"2103772901182742953\"],\"rank\":1}, \n {\"cohort\":\"tron_tag_only\",\"template_hash\":\"6a8cef3b40af3709e8916117a1eeddeb\",\"posts\":6,\"authors\":5,\"first_at\":\"2026-08-17T23:33:52+00:00\",\"last_at\":\"2026-09-26T10:02:38+00:00\",\"ids\":[\"2089495958069362800\",\"2089501736478052434\",\"2089522781411041398\",\"2089529833113940393\",\"2089538739353624845\",\"2103787321036321109\"],\"rank\":2}, \n {\"cohort\":\"tron_tag_only\",\"template_hash\":\"ec4e2e376654cf51e311fca9e2a30f91\",\"posts\":5,\"authors\":4,\"first_at\":\"2026-08-20T03:39:04+00:00\",\"last_at\":\"2026-08-20T06:49:03+00:00\",\"ids\":[\"2090282443534196905\",\"2090289804294410413\",\"2090307272027070741\",\"2090307332945170540\",\"2090330255013593153\"],\"rank\":3}, \n {\"cohort\":\"tron_tag_only\",\"template_hash\":\"f841bd160a82cfce6b31885a9be7b19b\",\"posts\":5,\"authors\":5,\"first_at\":\"2026-08-17T23:33:04+00:00\",\"last_at\":\"2026-08-18T02:21:08+00:00\",\"ids\":[\"2089495760299810831\",\"2089500839215792505\",\"2089522398714384856\",\"2089529329973629272\",\"2089538055505903721\"],\"rank\":4}, \n {\"cohort\":\"tron_tag_only\",\"template_hash\":\"4cebbb0ca46f2fe5d18f639cd8abbce4\",\"posts\":4,\"authors\":1,\"first_at\":\"2026-09-26T08:58:11+00:00\",\"last_at\":\"2026-09-26T09:08:29+00:00\",\"ids\":[\"2103771103495692753\",\"2103773214115561617\",\"2103773415161180480\",\"2103773693981626872\"],\"rank\":5}], \"candidate_collisions\" : [{\"cohort\":\"tron_tag_only\",\"tweet_id\":\"2104664285947539715\",\"author_id\":\"3131128732\",\"author_handle\":\"AdrianaCrosing\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-28T20:07:23+00:00\",\"text\":\"Hey guys, so I was digging into the latest stats from https://t.co/jm2S1qd7sL and honestly, the growth is mind-blowing. They just hit a daily token throughput of 1.11T, which is insane. This platform is now in a whole new league, rivaling even the big dogs like OpenRouter.\\n\\nSo, how does https://t.co/jm2S1qd7sL do it? Well, it's all about their core infrastructure. https